OL,3,GNEWSAWoman named among Britons missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from west London has been named
OL,7,Fas one of the 33 British nationals
OL,8,Fmissing after devastating flash floods
OL,9,Fin Nepal.
OL,11,FFishtail Tours and Travels confirmed
OL,12,FLeena Bector, from Slough, was among 27
OL,13,Ftravellers linked to the tour company
OL,14,Fwho remain unaccounted for.
OL,16,FHer husband, Bhupesh Bector, told The
OL,17,FTimes: "I know that she's in Nepal for
OL,18,Fsure, so even if they find her today or
OL,19,Ftomorrow, I need to be there."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
