OL,3,GNEWSAWoman named among Britons missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe missing Britons are among hundreds
OL,7,Fof people unaccounted for as rescue
OL,8,Fefforts continue in the Rasuwa
OL,9,Fdistrict, which borders China's Tibet
OL,10,FAutonomous Region. The floods struck on
OL,11,FWednesday after a glacier collapse
OL,12,Ftriggered landslides and sent torrents
OL,13,Fof mud, water and debris downstream.
